---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Miguel Zapata - Escultor, Pintor y Grabador"
	lang="es"
	description="Miguel Zapata (1940-2014). Obra completa del escultor, pintor y grabador español. Fusión única de tradición renacentista y expresionismo moderno."
>
	<main class="min-h-screen">
		<!-- Header / Navigation -->
		<header class="bg-stone-900 text-white py-6 px-4 sticky top-0 z-50 shadow-lg">
			<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex justify-between items-center">
				<h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-wide">Miguel Zapata</h1>
				<nav class="flex items-center gap-6">
					<a href="/es/" class="hover:text-amber-400 transition">Inicio</a>
					<a href="/es/biografia/" class="hover:text-amber-400 transition">Biografía</a>
					<a href="/es/obra/" class="hover:text-amber-400 transition">Obra</a>
					<a href="/en/" class="px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded hover:bg-white/20 transition text-sm">EN</a>
				</nav>
			</div>
		</header>

		<!-- Hero Section -->
		<section class="relative h-[70vh] flex items-center justify-center bg-gradient-to-br from-stone-800 to-stone-900">
			<div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-30">
				<img src="/intro/media/toro.jpg" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
			</div>
			<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-stone-900/80 to-stone-800/80"></div>
			<div class="relative text-center text-white px-4 z-10">
				<h2 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold mb-6">Miguel Zapata</h2>
				<p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-stone-300 mb-4">Escultor, Pintor y Grabador</p>
				<p class="text-lg text-stone-400">1940 - 2014</p>
				<div class="mt-8">
					<a href="/es/obra/" class="inline-block px-8 py-4 bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-700 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg transition shadow-lg">
						Explorar Obra
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Introduction -->
		<section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-20 px-4">
			<div class="prose prose-lg prose-stone mx-auto">
				<h3 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-center">Una Visión Única del Arte</h3>
				<p class="text-lg text-stone-700 leading-relaxed">
					Miguel Zapata (Cuenca, 1940 - Madrid, 2014) fue un artista español cuya obra trasciende las categorías tradicionales.
					Su trabajo fusiona la tradición renacentista con el expresionismo moderno, creando piezas que son simultáneamente pintura,
					escultura y grabado.
				</p>
				<p class="text-lg text-stone-700 leading-relaxed">
					Desde su formación en Cuenca hasta su trabajo en el Meadows Museum de Dallas, Texas, Zapata desarrolló un lenguaje
					artístico único que explora temas como el patrimonio arquitectónico español, figuras históricas y la fusión del
					pasado con el presente.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Gallery Categories -->
		<section class="bg-stone-100 py-20 px-4">
			<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
				<h3 class="text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-12">Categorías de Obra</h3>
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
					<a href="/es/obra/grabado/" class="group relative aspect-square bg-stone-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300">
						<img src="/images/gallery/Caballero-Durero-1-1.jpg" alt="Grabado" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500" />
						<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 to-transparent group-hover:from-black/50 transition-all duration-300"></div>
						<div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-6 text-center">
							<h4 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Grabado</h4>
						</div>
					</a>
					<a href="/es/obra/dibujo/" class="group relative aspect-square bg-stone-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300">
						<img src="/images/gallery/Estudio-mural-II-1.jpg" alt="Dibujo" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500" />
						<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 to-transparent group-hover:from-black/50 transition-all duration-300"></div>
						<div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-6 text-center">
							<h4 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Dibujo</h4>
						</div>
					</a>
					<a href="/es/obra/tecnica-mixta/" class="group relative aspect-square bg-stone-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300">
						<img src="/images/gallery/Cardenal-Z-1..jpg" alt="Técnica Mixta" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500" />
						<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 to-transparent group-hover:from-black/50 transition-all duration-300"></div>
						<div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-6 text-center">
							<h4 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Técnica Mixta</h4>
						</div>
					</a>
					<a href="/es/obra/oleo/" class="group relative aspect-square bg-stone-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300">
						<img src="/images/gallery/El-beso-1.jpg" alt="Óleo" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500" />
						<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 to-transparent group-hover:from-black/50 transition-all duration-300"></div>
						<div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-6 text-center">
							<h4 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Óleo</h4>
						</div>
					</a>
					<a href="/es/obra/escultura/" class="group relative aspect-square bg-stone-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300">
						<img src="/images/gallery/Farinata-1.jpg" alt="Escultura" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500" />
						<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 to-transparent group-hover:from-black/50 transition-all duration-300"></div>
						<div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-6 text-center">
							<h4 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Escultura</h4>
						</div>
					</a>
					<a href="/es/obra/collage/" class="group relative aspect-square bg-stone-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300">
						<img src="/images/gallery/Acordeón-1.jpg" alt="Collage" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500" />
						<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 to-transparent group-hover:from-black/50 transition-all duration-300"></div>
						<div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-6 text-center">
							<h4 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Collage</h4>
						</div>
					</a>
				</div>
				<div class="text-center mt-12">
					<a href="/es/obra/" class="inline-block px-8 py-4 bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-700 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg transition shadow-lg">
						Ver Todas las Obras
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Footer -->
		<footer class="bg-stone-900 text-white py-12 px-4">
			<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center">
				<p class="text-stone-400">&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Miguel Zapata. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
				<p class="text-stone-500 mt-2 text-sm">Sitio creado en memoria del artista</p>
			</div>
		</footer>
	</main>
</Layout>
